OL,3,GNEWSAFull reservoir remains unused in
OL,4,A'severe drought'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe water level at South East Water's
OL,7,FArdingly reservoir is so low that last
OL,8,Fweek the Environment Agency declared a
OL,9,F'severe drought' in the parts of Sussex
OL,10,Fit serves.
OL,12,FHowever, less than six miles away from
OL,13,FArdingly in Haywards Heath, Southern
OL,14,FWater's Weir Wood reservoir sits nearly
OL,15,Ffull because a water treatment works at
OL,16,Fthe site has been out of action since
OL,17,F2018.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
