OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1792670212
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFull reservoir remains unused in
OL,4,A'severe drought'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the end of 2025, when Ardingly
OL,7,Freached worrying low levels, South East
OL,8,FWater drew up emergency plans to run an
OL,9,Foverground pipeline between the two
OL,10,Freservoirs.
OL,12,FThat plan was shelved when it started
OL,13,Fraining, but could the millions and
OL,14,Fmillions of litres of water sitting in
OL,15,FWeir Wood still be the answer to
OL,16,FArdingly's supply problem?
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
